    {
      "id": "16931be6-d57c-4dda-8c1e-b14502ad7a2e",
      "name": "Sticky Note6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 680,
        "height": 1040,
        "content": "## Turn a Telegram form into Sora 2 Pro storyboard UGC ads\n\n### How it works\n1. A Telegram message starts the flow and sends a form: brand, product info, product photo, video length, scene count, orientation, concept and spoken language.\n2. The product photo is uploaded to imgbb to get a public URL.\n3. GPT-4o describes the photo and Perplexity researches the product and its target audience.\n4. An AI agent (GPT-5.1) writes a multi-shot storyboard plus a prompt for the opening frame.\n5. Nano Banana Pro (Kie AI) generates the first frame, then Sora 2 Pro Storyboard renders the video.\n6. Both jobs are polled until done; the video file and link are sent back on Telegram. Failures are reported in the chat.\n\n### Setup\n- [ ] **Telegram:** create a bot with @BotFather and add the credential to every Telegram node\n- [ ] **imgbb:** create a free account at [imgbb](https://imgbb.com/), open About > API, copy the key and paste it into the `key` field of **Foto\u011fraf\u0131 Linke \u00c7evir**\n- [ ] **OpenAI:** on platform.openai.com add credit under Billing, create an API key and add it as a credential\n- [ ] **Perplexity:** on perplexity.ai open Account > API, add credit under API Billing, create an API key and add it as a credential\n- [ ] **Kie AI:** sign up at [Kie AI](https://kie.ai?ref=c29fcd9c92ad897e8868df9182112560), top up credits, create an API key and add a **Header Auth** credential to the Kie HTTP nodes (Name: `Authorization`, Value: `Bearer YOUR_API_KEY`)\n\n### Customization\n- Adjust the wait times (2 min image, 10 min video) to match queue times\n- Edit the AI Agent system prompt to change tone, shot style or rules\n- Swap GPT-4o for the disabled Gemini node, or Nano Banana Pro for Nano Banana"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
